@host = http://localhost:8000
@api = {{host}}/api/v1

### Register a book
POST {{api}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Dom Casmurro",
  "author": "Machado de Assis",
  "published_date": "1899-12-01",
  "summary": "Bentinho narra a dúvida sobre a fidelidade de Capitu."
}

### Search by title
GET {{api}}/books?title=casmurro

### Search by author (accent and case insensitive)
GET {{api}}/books?author=MACHADO

### Free text: title OR author, newest first
GET {{api}}/books?q=assis&sort=published_date&order=desc&limit=10

### Get one (replace the id)
GET {{api}}/books/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Partial update
PATCH {{api}}/books/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{ "summary": "Novo resumo." }

### Delete
DELETE {{api}}/books/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Probes
GET {{host}}/health/live

###
GET {{host}}/health/ready
